config I225_V
    tristate "Intel I225-V 2.5GbE Ethernet"
    default y
    help
      Native PCIe Ethernet for Intel I225-V (8086:15f3). The driver uses
      one RX/TX queue and the existing network device interface. MSI notifies
      the network service when available; otherwise the driver uses polling.
      Frame processing always runs in task context.
      Other I225 variants and I226 controllers are not matched.
